{"id":"n89917-12-13","stage":0,"title":"없다 · 没有","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89917-12-13-1","ko":"자녀가 몇이나 됩니까?","zh":"您有几个孩子呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자녀가","meaning":"子女","explanation":"자녀：子女；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자녀","audio":"/audio/fb699cb7a0a6e3007f52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24770","senseId":"1","lemma":"자녀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자녀가","audio":"/audio/be396faa087f61e2451b.mp3"}},{"text":"몇이나","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇이나","audio":"/audio/e390eafffd1a7c020188.mp3"}},{"text":"됩니까?","meaning":"有","explanation":"되다：有；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"4","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됩니까","audio":"/audio/571187496de842dc35bb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fb699cb7a0a6e300","term":"자녀","zh":"子女","audio":"/audio/fb699cb7a0a6e3007f52.mp3","entryId":"24770","definition":"父母养育的儿子或女儿；或指儿子和女儿。","pronunciation":["자녀"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"填满或达到一定的数量。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/aef663b32beae482567b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89917-12-13-2","ko":"딸은 없고 아들만 둘이에요.","zh":"没有女儿，只有两个儿子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"딸은","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemm